<title>Somalia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/somalia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-somalia-2026-11-04T15:37:13.678Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 15:37:13 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Turkey has stepped up airstrikes in Somalia, raising the civilian death toll, while Uganda is accelerating the withdrawal of its African Union peacekeeping troops and Ethiopia is planning a similar pullout as fighting intensifies. The United States has withdrawn its forces from the strategic Baledogle airfield, and joint airstrikes by the US and an East African nation continue against an al-Qaeda-linked group. Puntland mercenaries are fighting alongside Sudanese RSF forces, and the Sudanese army reports northern Somali fighters supporting the RSF. A Somali police officer was killed by an aircraft propeller at Dhusamareb Airport, and there were 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxNOVlNOGdWZGNMcExOVVJvcWJoUTIzdVl2X3A1MWNmbzZyd2M5cFBPZmJ3SnQtMFBYdFdXMFhCdDhsX2QzY0lHYkF0Z216VVo0MUV0azNTRE1wUnAtUTZZM0lKdldFUDRxTE5Md004ZzBkS1dMTGVuWmlSZHhyemtmN0N6cTFqQ3lFeC1NRHgwUlh6SV93OVZkU0ZKbDFsZGtFeUhB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxON1NUWFFwY2dfX002Nm40NWVSdlROclFWazV4X3hGd2hIQ1FNMndwRlNmTVRnZ2lGbjNza3hxSEhLaFFVaWxZTVRrWDFvR3hkTkdCR3V4X0s5MTlRbmJxeS0wRlBrcFI5MzljaE55cFBuQVlaS19rTXVDS19vSjFKZGFET0pyNVhBZFJWaC1QUUF0VHg5T1BxRWZ4WV_SAZwBQVVfeXFMTkV4RXZxSkhTYmdkdVV5UVl1SXlNUTNaRFFBZVdINTBCMHdJdUtJRHBlX1gxendROHhXeFJ5d3htWkdVQVpnQzRoOFZlQjIyRG10T0dGbGdfdTNyaFowdzJya2U2UVR6U0xBN05TSlFQRURWaXRXM1UwMjV3T2daVWtfWUY2a2NSaGNfdFZkVmRiWWhQWjBIcm55OWlI?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE5OLTVsNnI2UzI5b2RxaXRoc3g0ZWU4bXhYSzliS3FPWUc5a0VCbmR1cnhWNXRPN0JsUlU2QmZGWXBIblQ2bUFOTGpVdUdNY0phYlgyU1piRHN4Q0c0N0E?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxQZ1hSODQ3U